    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ultra_detail",
      "x": 495,
      "y": 138,
      "width": 281.25,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "Enhanced planning system with\n\"teleportation\" capability.\n\nTeleport = context-switch mid-plan to\ngather information from a different part\nof the codebase, then return.\n\nLike an interrupt handler for planning —\npause plan, scout ahead, resume plan.",
      "originalText": "Enhanced planning system with\n\"teleportation\" capability.\n\nTeleport = context-switch mid-plan to\ngather information from a different part\nof the codebase, then return.\n\nLike an interrupt handler for planning —\npause plan, scout ahead, resume plan.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
